.SH NAME
zhen\-codeindex \- Build Zhen's source shard: symbols, Go call graph and word search over committed code.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zhen\-codeindex
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build Zhen's source shard: symbols, Go call graph and word search over committed code.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-out \fISTRING\fR
index directory (default /var/zhen/code\-index)
.TP
.B \-\-repo \fISTRING\fR
git repository (default .)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
zhen\-codeindex \-\-repo . \-\-out /var/zhen/code\-index
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
